<p>Follow these steps to register one click presets.</p>
<ol>
<li><p>Open the printing preferences dialog box.</p></li>
<li><p>Click the <span class="Term-Soft">Frequently Used 
 Settings</span> tab, and then select a one click preset from <span class="Term-Soft">One 
 Click Preset List:</span> upon which you want to base the new one click 
 preset.</p></li>
<li><p>Modify settings on this tab.<br/>
 As necessary, you can also modify settings on the <span class="Term-Soft">Detailed 
 Settings</span> tab.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class="help-step-extra">
<ul>
<li>
<p class="Normal-indent">The following features settings are not stored 
 for one click presets.</p>
<ul>
<li><p><span class="Term-Soft">User ID</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">File Name</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">Password</span>, 
 <span class="Term-Soft">User Name</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">Classification 
 Code</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">User Code</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">Login 
 User Name</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">Login Password</span>, <span class="Term-Soft">Folder 
 Password</span>, watermark items except <span class="Term-Soft">Print Watermark</span> 
 (On/Off) and selected watermark name, overlay items except <span class="Term-Soft">Add 
 Overlay</span> (On/Off) and selected overlay name, bitmap items except 
 <span class="Term-Soft">Add Bitmap</span> (On/Off) and selected bitmap name, 
 color profile items except selected color profile name.</p></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<ol start="4">
<li><p>Click <span class="Term-Soft">Register Current Settings...</span> 
 to open the dialog box.</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start="5">
<li><p>Enter a name and comment.<br/>
 The name can be up to 128 single-byte or 64 double-byte characters.<br/>
 The comment can be up to 512 single-byte or 256 double-byte characters. 
 You can insert line breaks.</p></li>
<li><p>Click <span class="Term-Soft">OK</span> to register 
 the one click preset and close the dialog box.<br/>
 The <img alt="" class="help-icon" height="16" loading="lazy" src="~/images/help/NOT_SHARED_ICON.gif" width="16"/> icon is displayed on the registered one click preset.</p></li>
</ol>
